This license covers the code in this repository, which was written from the
published paper (arXiv:1910.01739). It does not cover the paper itself, which
remains the authors' work.

The official TuRBO implementation (github.com/uber-research/TuRBO) is
distributed under the Uber Non-Commercial License. No source was copied from
it. It was consulted to resolve implementation details the paper leaves
unspecified; every such case is tagged [FROM_OFFICIAL_CODE] in the source and
listed in REPRODUCTION_NOTES.md.
